Tue Sep  1 12:28:04 UTC 2026 - Stefan Dirsch <sndirsch@suse.com>

- upated to 1.0.5 release tarball
  * Fix building on FreeBSD
  * Some fixes for handling the attribute list in
    eglCreateWindow/PixmapSurface
  * Add a setting to tell egl-x11 to run on the normal NVIDIA Xorg
    driver. Requires DRI3 1.2 support, which was added in 595 and
    later drivers.
- supersedes the following patches
  0001-Fix-attribute-handling-for-eglCreateWindow-PixmapSur.patch
  0002-Handle-eglQuerySurface-EGL_RENDER_BUFFER.patch
  0003-Bump-version-number-to-1.0.5.patch
  0004-Enable-implicit-sync-if-we-re-talking-to-the-NVIDIA-.patch
  0005-Fix-building-on-FreeBSD.patch
- added latest patches from git
  * 0001-base-Use-an-rwlock-for-the-surface-list.patch
